{% extends 'admin/base.html' %}{% block title %}Help Center | Learnova{% endblock %}{% block content %}<div class="help-hero"><span class="eyebrow">LEARNOVA SUPPORT</span><h1>How can we help?</h1><p>Use these guides to manage the LMS confidently.</p><div class="help-search"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i><input placeholder="Search help topics..." data-help-search></div></div><section class="help-grid" data-help-grid><article><i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i><h3>Create Accounts</h3><p>Add students and instructors, set academic profiles, and reset passwords.</p></article><article><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i><h3>Manage Courses</h3><p>Create courses, assign instructors, and enroll students.</p></article><article><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i><h3>Assessments</h3><p>Instructors can manage units, assignments, quizzes, exams, and grading.</p></article><article><i class="fa-solid fa-comments"></i><h3>Discussions</h3><p>Create course topics, reply, attach files, pin, lock, and moderate content.</p></article><article><i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i><h3>Certificates</h3><p>Certificates become available after completion and a passing final grade.</p></article><article><i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i><h3>Data Storage</h3><p>Data remains saved inside instance/ecms.db after stopping the server.</p></article></section>{% endblock %}